VAX 6440? Each processor is rated at 7.0 VUPS, and the number says
that it has 4 processor.

Net result is somewhat short of 28 VUPS. It isn't possible to get a
VUPS value for a Alpha 2100 5/250, but it's possible to do some
approximation based on the published SpecInt92/SpecFp92.

My guess would be that it would be something like 10 times faster in
integer and the difference is likely bigger in floating point. This is
a very rough estimate, but I don't know how to do a better one. 

Note that I compared the performance of the four cpu's to a single cpu
Alpha 2100 5/250. The difference will likely be larger for individual
jobs, and you could have more than one CPU in the 2100 5/250...

