One gotcha that I ran into with DS100s is that they like the SQE
signal to be enabled on the Ethernet transceiver. My recollection is
that they start to download but fail after the primary bootstrap code
has loaded.

The other thing is to make sure that the filename matches the default
requested by the DS100 (PS0801ENG.SYS I think). I believe that if you
turn enough DECnet logging on you will see some relevant messages if
the DS100 is attempting the download.

I think the Port 1 nominal settings are 4800-N-1.

