                                    Use the VMS version of UNZIP to unpack
                                    the .ZIP files while restoring VMS file
                                    attributes.

        If you don't want to roll-your-own  'getopt', look at any of the
    various  VMS  ports  of unix utilities.  I found a  version  in  the
    sources for XV which claims to have come from net.sources, but other
    packages almost certainly include a similar, or the same, function.

