this type of RAM is impressive.  It could speed machines up
quite a lot, and make them cheaper by removing the L2 cache
common in today's machines.

Here's what RAMTRON claims for its product:

"Ramtron's EDRAM product family was designed to
overcome the widening gap between microprocessor
performance and memory performance. The 4Mb
