wl101@namaste.cc.columbia.edu (Wentian Li) writes...

>we just purchased a DEC alpha 250 (OSF/1 v3.2b), and
>i'm connecting it to the ethernet via twisted-pair
>(10Base-T) wire. i know in the console, one can
