<Paribas@twics.com> writes:
>I have a Nakamichi MBR-7 CDROM changer (7 CDs)
>it uses LUNs to select the loaded CDs
>and comes only with two drivers (Mac+Win)
>
>I heard from somebody who heard from somebody... :-)
>..who managed to get the same kind of drive running
>under SunOS by just reconfiguring the kernel.
>
>On both VMS and ULTRIX I can see the drive but can't mount it.
>
>could anybody help with advice on how to probably get the CD 
>changer runnning under VMS, ULTRIX, OSF
>
>thanks in advance
