Sounds like a problem with the terminal control database - 
/etc/auth/system/ttys.  Do a "man ttys" for some more info.

The other possibility is a permission problem on the /dev/pty*
files.

Does this problem happen at log in, or not until he tries to run xterm/dxterm?

